  "description": "Operating Area: Croatia\n\nAfter her second refit, Yacht Bella is able to accommodate up to 21 guests (20+1) in its mesmerizing 10 smart cabins (everything can be operated by voice). The new features also include a gentlemen's whiskey and cigar lounge, a beauty lounge, a kids' playroom, a cinema room, a fitness/pilates room, and top-of-the-line water toys.",
